  "testMethod": "The worker constructs the successful correlated Resume reply after the native queue claim and turn receipt commit. The probe holds that reply on the old socket. The fixture defers competing server-origin claims for the first prompt until the worker start is observed. It then kills and replaces the worker-owning server with the browser peer still running. The newer-Pause case lets the single original turn finish and pauses the chat while the earlier Resume still awaits acknowledgment.",
